{
  "_": [
    "Which core test projects a change runs (docs/design/architecture-review.md step 6.3, docs/TESTING_LAYERS.md). modules.mjs reads it; gates.sh and land.sh ask it.",
    "A changed path belongs to the FIRST module whose paths match it (globs: * within a folder, ** across folders), or for the Chemistry test files to the module whose 'props' names its item list in core/Chem.Tests.props: that split is read from the props file, never copied here.",
    "'projects' are code: those core projects run, and every project that references them (ProjectReferences, followed transitively; Chem.Tests.props's count for each project that imports it). A library (Game.Core, Rules.Mcp) runs its dependents.",
    "'reads' are data: those test projects read the files, and run alone (who references them doesn't matter).",
    "A module with neither runs no dotnet tests (docs, tools). A path in no module runs everything: the fail-safe.",
    "Every Chem.* project but Chem.Land.Tests links the Runtime through Game.Core, so each Runtime area above the land runs everything but the land's own tests; 'after' says which project it narrows to once it's an assembly of its own. Chemistry/Mcp and Playtest/Logic compile into Game.Core too, so they run the same.",
    "'stop' (step 5c): projects whose dependents aren't followed for that module's changes; what's past them gets the smoke. runtime-land stops at Game.Core (Andrew, 2026-11-26). check takes the same cut.",
    "core/ files in no module (Chem.Tests.props, Directory.Build.props, the solution, the runsettings, TestParallel.cs, TestFriends.cs) run everything, as any unmapped path does.",
    "modules.mjs check (run by gates.test.mjs) proves the map agrees with the csproj files: every file a project compiles must select that project."
  ],
  "smoke": "TestCategory=Unit",
  "modules": [
    { "name": "runtime-land", "projects": ["Chem.Land"], "stop": ["Game.Core"], "paths": [
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Land/**"
    ], "_": "Chem.Land's own assembly (step 5a). Andrew's ruling (2026-11-26, step 5c): a Land change runs Chem.Land.Tests and Chem.LandWorld.Tests (they reference Chem.Land), and not what reaches it only through Game.Core: those get the Unit smoke, and CI's full run after every push to dev catches the rest. Its adapters onto a world (World.Land, GeneratedSource, BakedSource, MapBake, MapCheck, GeneratedPlaces, CellHeightfield, OpenWorld*) are Sim's: runtime-sim, everything." },
    { "name": "runtime-rules", "after": ["Chem.Rules.Tests"], "projects": ["Game.Core"], "paths": [
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Rule*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Mod*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Components*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Spell*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/RadialLayout*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/MaterialGroups*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Look*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Colors*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/GameFolders*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/PlayerStats*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Items*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Fauna*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Downed*"
    ] },
    { "name": "runtime-play", "after": ["Chem.Play.Tests"], "projects": ["Game.Core"], "paths": [
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Hold*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Defense*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Hands*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/WorldPuzzles*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/World.Hold*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/World.Golf*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/World.Course*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/World.Defense*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/World.Dragon*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/World.Hands*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/World.Raiders*"
    ] },
    { "name": "runtime-lockstep", "after": ["Chem.Lockstep.Tests"], "projects": ["Game.Core"], "paths": [
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Lockstep*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/JoinSnapshot*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/Room*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/World.Room*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/StandKeeper*",
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/PlayerId*"
    ] },
    { "name": "runtime-sim", "after": ["Chem.Sim.Tests"], "projects": ["Game.Core"], "paths": [
      "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/Runtime/**"
    ] },
    { "name": "package-docs", "paths": ["packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/*.md", "packages/com.anweather.chemistry-core/*.md.meta"] },

    { "name": "tests-shared", "props": "ChemTestsShared", "projects": ["Chem.Shared.Tests"] },
    { "name": "tests-rules", "props": "ChemTestsRules", "projects": ["Chem.Rules.Tests"] },
    { "name": "tests-land", "props": "ChemTestsLand", "projects": ["Chem.Land.Tests"] },
